<title>GERMANY: Siemens 96/97 restructuring below 1 bln DM.</title>
<headline>Siemens 96/97 restructuring below 1 bln DM.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German electronics and engineering conglomerate Siemens AG said its restructuring costs in 1996/97 would be just below one billion marks.</p>
<p>The company said earlier its restructuring costs in 1995/96 were 760 million marks, down from 2.2 billion the year before.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
